Build container	Build all release platforms	2026-09-22T16:58:57.4598720Z             "body": "<!-- cairn-current-delivery:start -->\n### 当前交付与验收状态 · 2026-09-23\n\n**总控 #10 / 验收 #16 的完整原范围仍在执行，未整体完成。** 本轮完成 Worker 实际多维筛选、独立实体状态、筛选计数及来源变更缓存；下方全部原任务与复选框保留。\n\n- [本轮固定报告](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/0daf07ffff20d0b5762364e049199e4716d572d8/docs/jev-v2/evidence/B05-20260923-filter.md)：受测 S `aad7d0a`。App/内部两真实列表按最新决定及有序人工历史匹配第四主题、功能/载体/用途组合，同维 OR/跨维 AND；非法条件返回 400，历史可变投影不当权威输入。实体 not_run/failed/empty/nonempty/stale 独立，人工纠正不改变自动运行状态。\n- 计数按当前语义筛选，不随分页和状态页签缩小；列表/计数同一 D1 事务读取。缓存键包含新维度，迁移 0025 修复来源更新后 stale 详情与旧列表缓存不一致；升级、回退和失败事务回滚保留人工历史，未执行生产迁移。\n- [代码 CI](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-share/actions/runs/35753992469)成功：204 Worker 与 Android 门禁通过；Go make verify、八个独立实际 Worker/D1/R2+Go 场景通过。[固定 API26/35](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-share/actions/runs/35754020204)均 SUCCESS，各 23 普通 + 10 独立实际 Worker 阶段；普通 XML 的 10 skip 单独记录。原始产物已归档，这些设备场景不冒充新增全维收藏库验收。\n- 原失败→修复证据包括八项两路由回归、未筛选计数、来源更新缓存。33 共享向量、36 组历史层级与 80 组混合动作折叠通过。1,200 收藏/9,600 动作的本地查询找到唯一最旧匹配项，EXPLAIN 与实测读取量保留；不宣称生产 SLA 或任意规模性能。\n- **下一步仍需端侧接入：** Android 无关键词收藏库用 v1 载荷本地筛选，已复现第四主题/隐藏维度两项失败；Go BookmarkQuery/dashboard 仍未转发新维度和实体状态。继续实际 App/Go/Web 链路、字段弃权/队列状态组合、证据导航/实体 UI/导出及完整新旧/flag-off 矩阵。完整 [B07 十条审计](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/0daf07ffff20d0b5762364e049199e4716d572d8/docs/jev-v2/evidence/B07-20260922-scope-audit.md)、原 126 B 子任务、全部 R/SC、B08 policy/消融/检索/dev/holdout 和 B09 全局预算/收益均保留。\n- 前批证据继续有效：[搜索与凭据顺序](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/0daf07ffff20d0b5762364e049199e4716d572d8/docs/jev-v2/evidence/B07-20260923-search-session.md)、[单标签重置/历史缓存升级](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/0daf07ffff20d0b5762364e049199e4716d572d8/docs/jev-v2/evidence/B07-20260922-reset.md)、[状态/候选/来源](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/0daf07ffff20d0b5762364e049199e4716d572d8/docs/jev-v2/evidence/B07-20260922-state.md)、[B09 DNS](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/0daf07ffff20d0b5762364e049199e4716d572d8/docs/jev-v2/evidence/B09-20260922-dns.md)、[B08 自动参考](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/0daf07ffff20d0b5762364e049199e4716d572d8/docs/jev-v2/evidence/B08-20260922-automatic-reference.md)。\n\n无需人工标注；本轮 0 次付费调用，历史 43 次不变，dev/holdout 未使用。自动参考不冒充人类偏好 gold。两 PR 仍 Draft；未合并、未部署、未执行生产迁移、未关闭原 issues。\n<!-- cairn-current-delivery:end -->\n\nSeparates source retrieval, reading and replayable classification and adds multidimensional curation, evaluation and opt-in extensions. Current fixes confirm exact completion operations, release every half-open probe, repair missing source checkpoints, validate bound snapshot identity, enforce actual structured-input/request budgets, and align single-choice and reset behavior with Worker. Production evaluation code lives in internal/evaluation. Entity results now bind the verified snapshot identity and exact archived blocks; stale automatic entities are excluded and current human corrections agree across search, reading UI and Markdown exports.\n\nStored classification runs now preserve exact bounded wire identity, per-question semantics, resolved model, new-call usage and reused-run references. The real production store/read path re-evaluates only a changed question; display/threshold changes require no call. Unknown legacy history, latest partial results and aliases receive a bounded pre-call fallback; post-call model drift stops without a second full inference. Batched errors preserve actual usage and exclude mismatched-model answers. Production exports retain historical input identity and are machine predictions, never reference labels. [R3-10 evidence and logs](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/ee061e5e77e76b34b5b03693dc6601d4b161bb02/docs/jev-v2/evidence/R3-20260922-reuse.md). This batch uses eight local provider requests and zero paid calls.\n\nPolicy decisions now guard personal/content revision, target and every referenced run inside the transaction, compare actual resolved models and preserve complete foreign-key-protected references. Exact successful operations remain confirmable after later human/source changes. Projection writes also pin the latest decision, so delayed computations cannot replace newer caches. Legacy primary-only history remains explicitly incomplete. [R3-12 real D1 and production Go evidence](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/48f7cfe9023dda03c5afa3f388c34683dba000b5/docs/jev-v2/evidence/R3-20260922-decisions.md): 18 new D1 tests, complete references through the normal classifier/store/read path, alias drift rejection and lost-response recovery without extra inference; three local provider calls and zero paid calls in the new scenario.\n\nEvidence escalation now uses durable intent identity, an exclusive bounded owner lease, saved fetch checkpoints and atomic snapshot/requeue/receipt application. The real Go DTO handles new/replayed responses; pending alone never grants fetch ownership. A fresh processor recovers checkpointed results without repeating the external fetch, and archived blocks keep their original IDs, roles and metadata. [R3-06 real D1 and production recovery evidence](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/60e049764941dfb860e5b7a57c741a793e76a000/docs/jev-v2/evidence/R3-20260922-escalation.md): one external fixture HTTP fetch, two local provider calls, lost-checkpoint response replay, three bounded finalize failures, restart recovery and an unchanged third poll. Crashes before a checkpoint may consume the remaining bounded attempt; arbitrary external HTTP exactly-once is not claimed. Defaults remain off and this batch makes zero paid model calls.\n\nCurrent Share `babe6bb5ed01efef6d5c10da52e54afcad2cd9db` / Enricher `60e049764941dfb860e5b7a57c741a793e76a000` (evidence-only after tested code `c470d90c0bee57e28ef08e9bd17a625482290345`). Fixed-HEAD CI passes: [Share Worker/Android](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-share/actions/runs/35720844123), [Enricher test/lint/race and amd64/arm64 containers](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/actions/runs/35721183719).\n\nValidation: Worker tests/typecheck/deploy dry-run, Go make verify; 177 Worker tests and eight real Go/Worker/D1/R2 scenarios; the new evidence execution scenario also passes with the race detector; the earlier R3-09 batch also recorded 33 real Chrome checks. New snapshot fault cases make zero invalid model calls/runs, then one successful recovery call/run. Long source remains archived while actual outbound HTTP is bounded. Those R3 integration models are local fixtures; Android CI success is not a device-execution claim. The separate live reference evaluation below uses the real provider.\n\n[Entity identity and end-to-end evidence](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/8d68e9a62468e86147ee6b2baaa41dbd6ec0e890/docs/jev-v2/evidence/R3-20260922-entities.md): atomic operation receipts, empty/success preservation, stale-write rejection, custom archived block IDs, UI rejection/reset, real downloaded export and privacy cascade.\n\n[Current source/migration/browser evidence](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/8d68e9a62468e86147ee6b2baaa41dbd6ec0e890/docs/jev-v2/evidence/R3-20260922-provenance.md), [input budget](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/8d68e9a62468e86147ee6b2baaa41dbd6ec0e890/docs/jev-v2/evidence/R3-20260922-budget.md), [snapshot recovery](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/8d68e9a62468e86147ee6b2baaa41dbd6ec0e890/docs/jev-v2/evidence/R3-20260922-evidence.md), [single choice](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/8d68e9a62468e86147ee6b2baaa41dbd6ec0e890/docs/jev-v2/evidence/R3-20260922-curation.md), [atomic completion/recovery](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/8d68e9a62468e86147ee6b2baaa41dbd6ec0e890/docs/jev-v2/evidence/R3-20260922-runtime.md).\n\nAdditive migrations 0017/0018/0019/0020/0021/0022 were tested locally. Ambiguous old curation bytes are archived and existing override histories retained; neither is automatically certified as human labels. No production migration/deployment or merge was performed.\n\nMaster Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher#10; acceptance Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher#16. This remains Draft: R3-07, the complete original R/B/SC matrix, automatic-reference quality evaluation and independent acceptance remain open. This PR does not close the whole batch.\n\nThe classification evaluation now freezes 240 automatically authored reference samples before inference, validates grouped splits and reference provenance, and scores all six dimensions with explicit unknown/empty/abstention handling. Live runs require explicit sample/call/token budgets and private synced journals. Saved-wire recovery validates exact requests and identities through the production decoder without network access or retries. A real 0.99 probability-sum response exposed a floating-point boundary rejection, now fixed while preserving the existing 1% tolerance.\n\n[Automatic-reference training evidence](https://github.com/Alpenl/cairn-x-enricher/blob/8d68e9a62468e86147ee6b2baaa41dbd6ec0e890/docs/jev-v2/evidence/B08-20260922-automatic-reference.md): 43 real calls including the smoke duplicate, 277,046 input tokens, 42 complete training predictions. Offline recovery reused 24 saved responses at zero additional model calls. Training accepted-error rate is 5.46% and field coverage 61.43%; seven independent groups make the result inconclusive for promotion. Dev/holdout are untouched. Local make verify and make test-ablation pass; production thresholds and feature flags remain unchanged. Full policy fitting, ablations, retrieval and holdout acceptance are still open.\n",
